It's pretty easy to get protection from sacrificing, but there's a
trick to it.
#offer just until you get the "reconciliation" message.  Then drop the
luckstone, and then pray.  If you can, lower your luck by one or two
points before praying.  That increases the chance of getting protection
or hitpoints, and reduces the chance of getting a spellbook or crowned.
  The problem, of course, is creating the monsters to #offer.  There
are different ways, some require patience, some require a willingness
to play a certain abusive tactic, but either way, you can get your
naked AC down to, I think, -128.  Moderate amounts of protection are
pretty easy to get if you can cast create monster, and you can do the
trick of managing your luck.

Why haven't you done the castle?  Do you have any source of MR?

You've probably killed quite a few unicorns.  Collect their horns, they
